{
  "id": "grammar-7",
  "world": "grammar",
  "order": 7,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "介系詞：時間與地點",
  "titleEn": "Prepositions",
  "summary": "in、on、at、by、until、for、during 一次搞懂。",
  "minutes": 15,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "中文說「在」，英文要依情況選 in、on 或 at。",
        "時間：範圍越大用 in，越小用 at，日期和星期用 on。地點也是一樣的道理。",
        "多益還常考 by（在…之前完成）和 until（一直持續到…）、for（多久）和 during（在…期間）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "先記住大中小："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "介系詞",
          "時間",
          "地點"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "in（大範圍）",
            "in May、in 2025、in the morning",
            "in Taipei、in the room"
          ],
          [
            "on（某一天）",
            "on Monday、on May 5",
            "on the desk、on the second floor"
          ],
          [
            "at（一個點）",
            "at 9 a.m.、at noon",
            "at the airport、at the front desk"
          ],
          [
            "by／until",
            "by Friday（之前完成）／until 5 p.m.（一直到）",
            ""
          ],
          [
            "for／during",
            "for two hours（多久）／during the meeting（期間）",
            ""
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "口訣：月年用 in，星期日期用 on，幾點鐘用 at。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "The meeting is on Monday.",
          "zh": "會議在星期一。",
          "highlight": "on",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-7/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "The store opens at nine.",
          "zh": "這家店九點開門。",
          "highlight": "at",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-7/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "Please submit the form by Friday.",
          "zh": "請在星期五前交表格。",
          "highlight": "by",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-7/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "No phones during the presentation.",
          "zh": "簡報期間請勿使用手機。",
          "highlight": "during",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-7/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "The conference",
              "label": "主詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "is",
              "label": "是"
            },
            {
              "text": "in",
              "label": "大範圍"
            },
            {
              "text": "June.",
              "label": "月份"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "月份用 in"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Please",
              "label": "請"
            },
            {
              "text": "wait",
              "label": "等"
            },
            {
              "text": "until",
              "label": "一直到"
            },
            {
              "text": "5 p.m.",
              "label": "時間點"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "until 表示一直持續到那個時間"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "The meeting is in Monday.",
          "right": "The meeting is on Monday.",
          "why": "星期幾用 on。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "I will finish it until Friday.",
          "right": "I will finish it by Friday.",
          "why": "「在…之前完成」用 by；until 是一直持續到。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "He worked here during five years.",
          "right": "He worked here for five years.",
          "why": "說「多久」用 for；during 後面接一段事件，例如 during the meeting。"
        }
      ]
    },
